[center][size=5][b]Shut Up Refiners[/b][/size]
Mutes all the [i]refiners[/i] in No Man's Sky.[/center]

[b]What it does[/b]
Mutes the refiner drone as they work.

[b]Options[/b]
[list]
[*][b]Refiners[/b] - the small, medium and large refiner you place on a planet[/*]
[*][b]Refiners and Personal Refiner[/b] - those, plus the Personal Refiner in your Exosuit[/*]
[/list]

[b]Compatibility[/b]
[list]
[*]Modifies the refiner entity files under [i]MODELS/PLANETS/BIOMES/COMMON/BUILDINGS/PARTS/BUILDABLEPARTS/TECH/REFINER/ENTITIES/ [/i]and, for the [b]Refiners and Personal Refiner[/b] option, the player character entity under [i]MODELS/COMMON/PLAYER/PLAYERCHARACTER/PLAYERCHARACTER/ENTITIES/[/i].[/*]
[*]These files live in [i]NMSARC.Precache.pak[/i][/*]
[*]Built for Cosmos[/*]
[/list]

Built natively on Linux with my [url=https://github.com/SavageCore/AMUMSS/tree/feat/linux-support]AMUMSS Linux port[/url].

Source: [url=https://github.com/SavageCore/shutup-refiners]https://github.com/SavageCore/shutup-refiners[/url]